<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Instruction: Please refer to the information in the following passages to answer the question. When answering, ignore any irrelevant information from the passages, but retain all relevant details to provide a comprehensive and accurate response. Always cite for any factual claim. When citing several search results, use [1][2][3]. Cite at least one passage in each sentence.
</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question<span id="A1.SS1.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: {Question}
