</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question<span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: {Question}
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">References<span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">:
