<span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{Statement 1} [citation ids]
</span></span>
